# Several native-build tools (settings.gradle's includeBuild of
# gradle-plugin, Codegen's generateCodegenSchemaFromJavaScript task calling
# @react-native/codegen's CLI by a hardcoded node_modules-root path, etc.)
# expect @react-native/* subpackages directly at the node_modules root.
# pnpm's default strict linking won't create those symlinks for packages
# that are only transitive dependencies of react-native itself (never
# declared in this project's own package.json) - without this, native
# builds fail with "Included build .../gradle-plugin does not exist" or
# "Cannot find module .../codegen/lib/cli/.../combine-js-to-schema-cli.js".
public-hoist-pattern[]=@react-native/*
